E  = is_all_empty      A_  = is_all_alpha_or_underscore
A  = is_all_alpha      AN_ = is_all_alnum_or_underscore
AN = is_all_alnum      M   = all_match(ascii_alpha)
D  = is_all_digits     N   = all_match(nonascii)

A and M should agree on every well-formed string.

